  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PresenSetmanaCulturalSuera.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 16px;\">(25 fotos) La nit d&#39;aquest divendres ha comen&ccedil;at la XXXIII Setmana Cultural de Suera, que s&#39;allargar&agrave; fins dijous 10 d&#39;agost. A m&eacute;s d&#39;inaugurar-la amb la pres&egrave;ncia de l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garcia, al Fossaret s&#39;ha presentat el llibre &ldquo;La vida a ratos&rdquo;, de Carmen Meneu Garcia, amb lectura de poemes a c&agrave;rrec de diverses dones.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0452.jpg\" alt=\"img_0452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0454.jpg\" alt=\"img_0454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0455.jpg\" alt=\"img_0455\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0456.jpg\" alt=\"img_0456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0457.jpg\" alt=\"img_0457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0458.jpg\" alt=\"img_0458\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/suerapresentaciosemanacultural/img_0461.jpg\" alt=\"img_0461\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.de